[32m+[m[32m## 🎯 Key Improvements Explained[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 1. **Request Deduplication**[m
[32m+[m[32mWhen 2 components request the same data simultaneously, we now cache the promise and share it instead of making duplicate API calls. This saves bandwidth and reduces load.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 2. **Component Memoization**[m
[32m+[m[32mComponents only re-render when their actual props change, not when parents update. This prevents cascading re-renders.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 3. **Search Debouncing**[m
[32m+[m[32mSearch waits 500ms before making API calls, so typing "vacation" makes 1 API call instead of 8 (one per character).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 4. **Smart Caching**[m
[32m+[m[32mData stays fresh in cache for 5 minutes, reducing unnecessary API calls while keeping data current.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 5. **Accessibility First**[m
[32m+[m[32mEvery interactive element is keyboard accessible and properly labeled for screen readers.[m
