[32m+[m[32m## 🔄 Component Lifecycle Optimization[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Example: MovieCard Component[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mBEFORE:[m
[32m+[m[32m┌─────────────────────────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m│ MovieCard Props Change              │[m
[32m+[m[32m├─────────────────────────────────────┤[m
[32m+[m[32m│ ↓ Parent component updates          │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ ↓ All MovieCards re-render          │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ ↓ Even if their props didn't change │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ ↓ Performance hit                   │[m
[32m+[m[32m└─────────────────────────────────────┘[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAFTER (With React.memo):[m
[32m+[m[32m┌─────────────────────────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m│ MovieCard Props Change              │[m
[32m+[m[32m├─────────────────────────────────────┤[m
[32m+[m[32m│ ↓ Check with custom comparison      │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ IF props actually changed:          │[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ↓ Re-render (necessary)           │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ ELSE:                               │[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ↓ Skip re-render (optimization)   │[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ↓ Reuse previous output           │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ ↓ Performance boost ✨              │[m
[32m+[m[32m└─────────────────────────────────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
