[32m+[m[32m## 🚀 Request Deduplication Flow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mREQUEST SCENARIO:[m
[32m+[m[32m┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m│ Component A requests: /api/trending            │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ Component B requests: /api/trending (same!)    │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ Both at the same time                          │[m
[32m+[m[32m└────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m           ↓[m
[32m+[m[32m┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m│ WITHOUT Deduplication:                         │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ - Component A: Fetch /api/trending             │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ - Component B: Fetch /api/trending             │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ RESULT: 2 API calls to same endpoint ❌         │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ Wasted bandwidth & slower response             │[m
[32m+[m[32m└────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m           vs[m
[32m+[m[32m┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m│ WITH Deduplication (Our Implementation):       │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ - Component A: Fetch /api/trending             │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ - Component B: Sees same request in cache      │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ - Component B: Waits for A's request           │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ - Both get same result from 1 API call ✅      │[m
[32m+[m[32m│ RESULT: 1 API call, 50% bandwidth saved        │[m
[32m+[m[32m└────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
