[32m+[m[32m## 🎯 Search Optimization Flow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mBEFORE:[m
[32m+[m[32mUser Types: "A"[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ Instant API call → /search?q=A[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ Result: Too many movies starting with A[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ User types: "VA"[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ API call → /search?q=VA[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ User types: "VA"[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ API call → /search?q=VA (duplicate!)[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ User types: "VAN"[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ API call → /search?q=VAN[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ ...etc...[m
[32m+[m[32mTOTAL: 10-20 API calls for one search! ❌[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAFTER (500ms Debounce):[m
[32m+[m[32mUser Types: "A" (waits 500ms)[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ (if nothing else typed)[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ API call → /search?q=A[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ User types: "V" (within 500ms)[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ Timer resets (no API call yet)[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ User types: "A" (within 500ms)[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ Timer resets (no API call yet)[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ User types: "N" (500ms wait)[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ API call → /search?q=VAN[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓ Results displayed[m
[32m+[m[32mTOTAL: 1-2 API calls for one search! ✅[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
